    // END-TO-END SHAPE CHECK against the REAL emitter. Build an array-index
    // function, run `generate_vcs`, find the IndexOutOfBounds VC, and confirm its
    // formula carries the `Ge(index, len)` OOB disjunct the adequacy lemma models
    // — i.e. Lemma 3 is stated against the shape the emitter ACTUALLY produces.
