    // guard `i < n` is DEFINITIONALLY `Int.le (i+1) n` — the reduced codomain
    // `I (exec e [i:=i+1])`), kernel-checks the per-function partial-correctness
    // instance modulo 3. The upper bound is INFERRED from the guard structure, USES the
    // guard (not the hypothesis), and is the COMPLEMENT of the lower bound.
