/// The per-function TOTAL-correctness instance for `loop_keep_zero` rests on ⊆ the 3
/// foundational axioms (propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice) — NO 4th axiom and no
/// `sorry`/`trustedArith` markers. Registers the instance and audits the transitive
